<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15209" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρκῠς</span></b>  (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅρκ-</span>
		<u>Et.Gen.</u>, cf. <i><span class="en">
			Paus.Gr.
			<u>Fr.</u>
			73
		</span></i>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">υος</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">,
		ἡ</span>: pl., nom. and acc., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρκυες, -υας,</span>
		
			Att.
		 acc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρκυς</span> (v.
			infr.):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>net,
				hunter's net,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1116
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ch.</u>
				1000
			</span></i>: more freq. in pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ἀρκύων πέπτωκεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					147
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρκύων μολεῖν ἔσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Cyc.</u>
					196
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρκυς ἱστάναι</span> to set
				<i>nets,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				6.5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διωκόμενον τὸν λαγὼ εἰς τὰς
				ἄρκυς</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλεξάμενος ἄρκυς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					790
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρκυες ξίφους</span>
			<i>the toils,</i> i. e. <i>perils,</i> of the sword, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				1278
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>woman's hair-net,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
